WEBVTT

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.530
It's not break time yet, Shimamu!

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:20.780
Let's go one more time!

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.270
You're pretty fired up.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:24.070
Of course!

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.830
Idol Fes is gonna be a huge event
for 346 Productions!

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:34.080
We've gotta get everything perfect during
practice and put on the best show of our lives!

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.670
Excuse me.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:37.330
Yes?

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:41.340
Producer has very important
announcement.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.840
He is wanting to call meeting.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.760
An important announcement?

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:51.890
Results from this training are
already visible in your practice sessions.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:56.410
I hope you will all continue exerting your
best efforts for the duration of the training.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:01:01.150
I have business to attend to and
will not return until tomorrow evening.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:07.950
In my absence, I would like
Nitta to lead training.

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:20.820
Please follow Nitta's directions
for the duration of my absence.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:25.370
Nitta, a word as leader, if you would.

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:30.250
For Idol Fes, we won't only
be performing as units.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:32.760
We'll also be performing
a new song together.

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:35.980
Singin' toge'er? Tha' soun's li'e fun!

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:37.500
What kind of song is it?

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.230
I can't wait to hear it!

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:42.400
...That means more work...

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:45.740
We'll continue practicing
as units until noon.

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:49.400
After that, we'll begin practicing
the new song together.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.910
It will be difficult to master a new song
as a group in such a short time frame,

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:54.990
but please do your best.

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.040
You got it!

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.710
We'll get it down perfect!

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:00.280
Thank you for the encouraging words.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:03.350
Nitta, I leave them in your care.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:03.960
Okay.

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:08.970
Let's start by going over our new song.

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:40.170
I had a quick look in the mirror

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:42.330
I had a quick look

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:40.210
in the mirror

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:04.170
It's hard getting everyone in sync, huh?

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:07.790
We just have to keep
practicing until we do!

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.140
From the top!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.420
R-Right! I'll do my best!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.930
This new song is really hard.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:23.470
It's hard enough trying to
remember the steps.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:25.690
I just couldn't keep up with everyone.

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:28.490
It was our first time practicing it.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:29.630
Yeah!

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:33.290
This concert's a perfect way
to make up for the last one!

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:36.060
We need to do it right this time.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:36.950
The last one?

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:43.080
I didn't have any fun
in our debut mini-concert.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:49.960
I was the leader, but I made
a huge mess for everyone.

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:51.670
M-Me too!

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:54.800
I stopped smiling halfway
through the concert.

00:04:55.720 --> 00:05:00.640
Maybe that concert isn't over for us yet.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:06.030
So let's do everything we can
for the new song and our unit songs!

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.940
I'll do my best no matter how it turns out!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.400
Okay?

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:18.190
One song's hard enough,

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.960
and now we're getting another?

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.200
We're in for a world of hurt.

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:26.030
But that means we'll have
plenty more chances for work.

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:28.460
You saw how practice went today.

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:33.960
It's gonna be hard getting
everyone in sync for this song.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.970
...Well, yeah, but...

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:43.840
We might overwork ourselves
...getting it right, only to mess up—

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:46.020
I'm so sorry!

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:49.990
Wait, don't Chieri.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:51.580
You'll hurt yourself.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.520
You okay?

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.440
Nyhm? Wha's goin' on?

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.980
...Um, I...

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:02.660
I'll go ge' a broom an' a dus'pan.

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.070
Huh?

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:07.290
Miku, you don't want to do
the new song with everyone?

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:10.650
...I can't say I don't...

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:13.390
I just think it's going to be kind of hard.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:14.670
...Yeah...

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:18.680
And we don't have our
unit song down right yet either.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:19.750
Huh?

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:22.050
Didn't you two break up?

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:23.260
No way!

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:23.260
Meow way!

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.890
...But at dinner, you said...

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:29.370
Eating rice with okonomiyaki?
Are you crazy?

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:32.300
Says mew! Putting ketchup on meowrs!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:35.260
Well, you put mayonnaise
on yours! So why not ketchup?

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:37.850
That logic meowkes meow sense!

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:41.450
We're breaking up!

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:41.450
Meow we're breaking up!

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:43.950
...That...

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:47.370
That's not what we're
talking about right meow.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:48.950
That's right!

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:51.630
And that isn't the problem.

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:56.840
I think we should prioritize our unit.

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:59.980
We were last to debut, after all.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.100
Kirari?

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:14.080
What's wrong?

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:16.130
You look kind of down.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:23.780
...Well...

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:28.290
I see.

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:31.490
So that's what Chieri
and Kanako think?

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:38.300
I though' tha' singin' toge'er
woul' be super fun.

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:42.140
But we have our uni's too.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:48.090
An' I know tha' some of the girls
...don' feel very good abou' i', so...

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:53.440
You don't know if we should
actually do the new song?

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:56.810
...Yeah...

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.950
I have to lead the training.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.530
Do you refuse?

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:17.820
No, I'm okay with leading it,

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:20.210
but I'm concerned about
adding this new song.

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:24.140
We don't have much time
before the concert.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:27.390
It'll be hard to get it
down well if we start now.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:31.930
Yes. I agree that it will be difficult.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:34.480
...However...

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:43.490
Instead of simply participating, wouldn't you
like to try climbing another, new stairway?

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:49.050
I would like to see all of you do that.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.450
You cannot sleep?

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:01.300
I was just thinking.

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.260
Rukopozhatiye.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:19.520
When I was difficult to sleep,
Mama would holding my hand.

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:25.530
Can you to sleeping now?

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.860
Yes.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:29.910
Spasibo.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:44.050
I couldn't match the others
in the dance today.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:50.050
Is it because I've never performed
with anyone else before?

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.530
...I'm out of juice...

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:15.070
Shimamu, it isn't break time yet.

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:18.160
Right. I'll do my best.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:20.250
Come on, guys, get up!

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:22.170
Let's do it again from the top!

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:27.070
Hey, isn't this a bit too hard?

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:31.050
We don't have all the steps down,
and no one's in sync.

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:34.090
That's why we need to practice more!

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:36.560
We won't make it in time
for Idol Fes if we don't!

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:41.060
I get the feeling it'll
just be a waste of energy.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:43.390
...That's not...

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:46.440
Wait, stop.

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:48.820
Why don't we take a break?

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.230
Okay, break time's over.

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:29.440
Instead of practicing our new song,
we'll be holding a "special program".

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.490
A special program?

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:35.200
Let's head outside, everyone.

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:38.790
A relay?

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:42.870
Right. We'll have an
inter-unit competition.

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:44.130
These will be the batons.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:49.470
Wait, hold on!
We don't have time for this!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:51.800
We need to practice the new song!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:57.470
I'm leading training today,
so please follow my orders.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.890
That's what Producer said, right?

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:07.900
Minami, is this really necessary?

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:10.280
You'll see once you try.

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:18.190
Miku, Riina, we need
to keep it three to a team.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.660
Could you be the announcers?

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:22.870
A-Announcers?

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:27.100
I heard that your emceeing
at your last event was amazing.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.620
Would you mind?

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:30.310
...W-Well...

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.420
...I don't remember what I did...

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:36.790
We're counting on you
to make it really fun.

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:38.760
Ranko, you'll be with us.

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:39.840
Huh?

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:42.650
We do our best together.

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:44.270
...Yes...

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:46.850
Okay, everyone.

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:50.360
Let's break up into units
and decide the running order.

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:53.700
...On your marks...

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.200
...get set...

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:57.280
Rock 'n' roll!

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:56.280
Meow!

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:59.910
And they're off meow!

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:02.780
Miria! You can do i'!

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:04.290
Let's win this!

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:13.530
The first runners are
meowking their last turn!

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:14.730
Here!

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.720
Why are we doing this?

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:17.260
Here!

00:13:25.390 --> 00:13:28.050
And meow Mio's taken the lead!

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:30.630
We'll see once we try?

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:31.520
Shiburin!

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:38.200
Oh meow!
Rin has dropped her unit's baton!

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:41.670
It's a turnaround!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.250
Meownami's in the lead!

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:52.590
Goal!

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:54.960
Meownami crosses first!

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:54.370
Goal!

00:13:58.360 --> 00:13:59.340
Good job.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:01.020
Good job!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.690
Sorry, I kind of spaced out.

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:04.700
...No, it's...

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:06.290
No big deal!

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.900
Next up is the candy-eating race!

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:19.770
...On your marks...

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:21.910
...get set...

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.200
Train!

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.200
Rock 'n' roll!

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:36.920
Wow! She already found the candy!

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:39.260
The god of sweets is on our side!

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:40.380
...But...

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.760
Mio's fast!

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:45.840
First place!

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:58.320
Next up is the four-legged race!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:04.830
Is your unit in sync?
It's time to test your unity!

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:06.950
...Now then, get set...

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.620
Rock 'n' roll!

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:11.870
One, two! One, two!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.970
In the lead is New Generations!

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.760
But Dekoration and
Candy Island aren't far behind!

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.010
...And at the tail, we have...

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:26.890
One, two! One, two!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:26.890
I guess slapping two units
together isn't great for sync!

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.890
One, two! One, two!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:35.360
New Generations crosses the finish line!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:39.070
Followed closely by
Dekoration and Candy Island!

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:40.820
...All that's left is...

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:46.840
Oh no! A fall!

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:51.870
They're trying to get up, but it
looks like they're having a hard time!

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:54.970
Let's go!

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:55.540
Y-You can do it!

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.500
Do your best!

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:58.860
Hang in there!

00:15:58.860 --> 00:15:59.550
You can do it!

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:01.730
...One, two...

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.800
Don't give up! It don't rock!

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:21.690
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:17.000
Nywo!

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:18.350
Kirari!

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:22.710
You move, you lose.

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:24.800
Those are the rules of war.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.180
It's waterproof?

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:02.210
You ready?

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:06.130
Let's start with an easy 30!

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:07.430
...One, two...

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.030
One!

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:10.330
Two!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:11.560
Three!

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:12.830
Four!

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:14.180
Five!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:17.830
...I'm so sorry! I messed up...

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.530
It's fine, Chieri!

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.830
...But it's my fault...

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:22.690
It's fine.

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:24.440
Don't sweat it, just relax.

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:27.310
Stay relaxed, and it'll be easy.

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:28.030
Yeah!

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:30.220
It's "One, two..."

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:32.250
One, two!

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:36.110
While feeling happy-happy!

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:40.170
...If our hearts are as one...

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.000
...Um... er...

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:47.130
It is as Ranko says.

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:49.440
...Our hearts as one...

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.180
Right! I'll do my best!

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:52.810
Chieri!

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:58.670
All right! Let's try this again!

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:01.180
Start us off, then, Minamin!

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.650
Huh? Me?

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.060
Please, Minami?

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:08.190
See any other Minamis here?

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:10.150
Minami.

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.410
Okay!

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:16.410
...One, two...

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:17.950
One!

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:19.460
Two!

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:20.960
Three!

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.460
Four!

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:23.960
Five!

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:25.460
Six!

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:26.960
Seven!

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:28.460
Eight!

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.440
Nine!

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:31.870
Ten!

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.470
It made sense after I tried.

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:44.370
Today's special program
was to bring our hearts together.

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:49.670
Sorry I panicked and didn't trust you.

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:52.860
No, I need to apologize too.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:55.580
I was supposed to lead training,

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.160
but we didn't really practice.

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:02.710
You see, before I was
selected for the Project,

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:06.420
I never even thought
I could be an idol.

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:11.530
It was really unexpected.

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:14.680
It was an adventure for me.

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:20.930
I met all of you,
and had the first unit debut.

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:25.400
I was happy, but also worried.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:30.530
But I only shouldered half the worry.

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:35.070
When I looked at the world after
overcoming our worries together,

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:37.790
my heart just wouldn't stop racing.

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:45.360
I was so glad that I went on that adventure,
that I took that first step.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:55.050
I think this concert is a chance
to glimpse a brand new world.

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:58.170
Not because I'm the leader.

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:06.670
But because I want to know
what I'll be able to see with all of you.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.420
I like that.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:13.490
What'll we see?

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:17.010
I wanna know too.

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:26.220
Never give up, always look forward and believe in yourself

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:33.040
I'm always watching you

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:44.450
The clear blue sky peeks through the spaces between the buildings

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:50.730
We walk down different paths, never stopping for a moment

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:56.810
Without resting and without looking back

00:21:56.810 --> 00:22:02.690
I want to stay by you and walk beside you

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:14.920
Wherever you go, take me with you, down this shining blue road

00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:30.340
Forever, stay by my side, even when we're far apart

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:36.750
One day, higher, higher, higher, I believe we can fly higher

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:42.670
The strength to believe will open the path to our destiny

00:22:43.390 --> 00:22:48.790
The world we saw that day shone like a blue topaz

00:22:55.490 --> 00:23:01.310
Faster, faster, faster, I believe we can run faster

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:06.990
The strength to believe will take us to our final destination

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:20.650
I have a suggestion.

00:23:21.850 --> 00:23:25.030
All of you will be
participating in Idol Fes.

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:31.630
I'd like you to choose a leader
from amongst yourselves.

00:23:32.280 --> 00:23:33.080
...Well...

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:38.920
Minamin, our leader.

00:23:39.880 --> 00:23:41.550
Let's go on this adventure together!

00:23:50.310 --> 00:23:52.940
Nitta, do you accept the role?

00:23:56.390 --> 00:23:57.310
Yes!
